{"4419410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dying Hope", "steam_appid": 4419410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying Hope is a space marine RTS centered around base building and survival. Set in a post apocalyptic future you command a cohort of humanity's remaining military personnel designated as Earth's final hope on an alien outpost planet. As you progress through the game you encounter varied challenges and discover the secrets of a long-lost outpost for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you'll be guided and helped, or hindered, by your quirky AI assistant who means well but can be at times distracted or short-sighted. Together you'll control the battlefield and organize the settling of this new strange home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll command everything from basic foot soldiers all the way up to up-armored tanks and mech units as you establish a foothold on the planet. But, as your foothold increases, so does the resistance to your presence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you secure Earth's second chance at planetary survival? Find out if you can reverse Earth's Dying Hope!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying Hope is a space marine RTS centered around base building and survival. Set in a post apocalyptic future you command a cohort of humanity's remaining military personnel designated as Earth's final hope on an alien outpost planet. As you progress through the game you encounter varied challenges and discover the secrets of a long-lost outpost for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you'll be guided and helped, or hindered, by your quirky AI assistant who means well but can be at times distracted or short-sighted. Together you'll control the battlefield and organize the settling of this n